# RetailSync QuickBooks workspace

- Follow `.agents/quickbooks/AGENTS.md`.
- Keep QuickBooks as its own workspace, not an accounting tab.
- Organize work by operational group: accounts, contacts, sales, money, operations, reports, tax.
- Preserve provider safety, idempotency, and external ID integrity.
- Keep create/edit/delete flows visible and testable where supported.
